  "description": "*Note: This is a promotional oneshot.*  \n[Promotional Webtoon](https://page.kakao.com/home/50631006)\n\n\"Stamp these divorce papers, please.\"\n\nAfter five years of marriage, my husband ended it with one envelope.\n\nI can't believe I was chased out by his nine-tailed fox-like lover. \n\n\"How dare you! You can't do this to me!\"\n\nIn a burst of anger, I opened my eyes and returned to the time before Ophelia's engagement, the spring when I was 18 years old. \n\nMy God-given second chance. I'll make a different choice this time. A dress instead of a knight's uniform, jewellery instead of swords!\n\nEckhardt Beyard, this time it's my turn. Take a taste of your own medicine for once. \n\nA courageous female knight is born again as a beautiful lady!\n\nOriginal Novel:       \n         [Kakao Page](https://page.kakao.com/content/50631006?tab_type=preview), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/777048070)",
